Cell["\<\
The renormalised stress tensor and the electric current, imported from the \
induced entry as tensors of this manifold so that the package's own index \
machinery raises, lowers and differentiates them. From here on they are \
objects of the boundary geometry, not arrays.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e2c7cd58-d4e6-496e-9c7d-9e66a108495f"],

