Cell["\<\
The total mass is the charge of k = d/dtbar. In the gauge inherited from the \
bulk the current term contributes nothing -- the paper notes this is a \
feature of that gauge, and it is verified here rather than assumed. The \
result is paper eq. (3.18) with the AdS radius restored.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b9c06f24-ab2b-437f-aca8-7ae70ba99b4c"],

